PERMITTED USES

You are free to:

  Share  — copy and redistribute the material in any medium or format.
  Adapt  — remix, transform, and build upon the material.

Under the following conditions:

  Attribution        — You must give appropriate credit to the original authors
                       (Shaban Ahmad & Tue Kjærgaard Nielsen), provide a link to
                       this licence, and indicate if changes were made. You may
                       do so in any reasonable manner, but not in any way that
                       suggests the authors endorse you or your use.

  NonCommercial      — You may not use the material for commercial purposes.
                       This includes, but is not limited to, any use by a
                       for-profit entity, any use in products or services
                       offered for sale or licensed for a fee, any use in
                       internal processes of a commercial organisation that
                       confers commercial advantage, or any use directed toward
                       commercial ends, whether or not profit is realised.

  No Additional      — You may not apply legal terms or technological measures
  Restrictions         that legally restrict others from doing anything this
                       licence permits.

