PROHIBITED USES

The following uses are expressly prohibited without explicit prior written
permission from the copyright holders:

  - Use by any commercial, industrial, or for-profit entity or organisation,
    including start-ups, biotechnology companies, pharmaceutical companies,
    chemical companies, environmental consultancies, and SaaS providers.
  - Integration into any commercial product, pipeline, platform, or service.
  - Use as part of any enterprise workflow, internal tooling, or infrastructure
    operated by a commercial organisation.
  - Use for the purpose of generating revenue, obtaining competitive advantage,
    or supporting profit-driven activities in any form.
  - Sub-licensing, selling, or otherwise transferring commercial rights to
    third parties.

